# The watchdog's drone (game/drone.h, drone_draw.c), seen from the city's entry roof. Booted on
# foot: out of the corridor as city.steps goes (up to the tower, strafe onto the right half, on out
# onto the entry), a step on and turned left (south: it's ~60 degrees left of out), out over the city: the drone rides the street
# between the plan's columns 1 and 2, its beam angled down, its scan line lighting the roofs back towards you. Shots
# as it waits, sweeps and rides down; then closer, on the floor it watches
wait_up
keydown up
wait 8.5
keyup up
hold l 2.2
wait 0.3
keydown up
wait 1.8
keyup up
wait 0.5
shot dr_00_on_the_entry
hold up 0.5
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
shot dr_01_turned_left
wait 0.7
shot dr_02
wait 0.7
shot dr_03
wait 1.5
shot dr_04
# On south off the entry onto the next roof down (row 6, 60 lower), turned left to face it: close
# up, in its fan, so its scan line finds you (red)
hold up 1.2
wait 0.3
hold left 0.3
wait 0.3
shot dr_05_close
wait 0.5
shot dr_06
wait 0.5
shot dr_07
wait 0.5
shot dr_08
wait 1.5
shot dr_09
wait 2.0
shot dr_10
wait 2.0
shot dr_11
